WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.100
A while loop keeps repeating for as long as its question is true.

2
00:00:05.026 --> 00:00:08.601
while asks its question before every lap of the loop.

3
00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:14.435
Plus equals adds to total, so the answer to the question changes.

4
00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:26.725
Twelve is not less than ten, so the loop stops.
